{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18079","headline":"路傍堠 · 韩愈","name":"路傍堠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堆堆路傍堠，一双复一只。\n迎我出秦关，送我入楚泽。\n千以高山遮，万以远水隔。\n吾君勤听治，照与日月敌。\n臣愚幸可哀，臣罪庶可释。\n何当迎送归，缘路高历历。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}